<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>For God to gain His army, priesthood, and dwelling place,</l><l>Defilement must be dealt with, that to Him we’d be chaste,</l><l>Make us the same as You, Lord, truly righteous and holy,</l><l>Meeting Your strict requirements, becoming Your army.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>In our journey to gain Christ—the good land giv’n by God,</l><l>Hindrances and trials would come when we walk with the Lord,</l><l>Through suff’rings we’d be humbled and in spirit contrite,</l><l>And be exposed through testing, thus purged and purified.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>To inherit the good land, we must be renumbered;</l><l>Make a willing vow to Him to fulfill His standard.</l><l>For the Lord’s up-to-date move, let’s fight and pay the price,</l><l>Enter and possess the land, our all-inclusive Christ!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
